  "description": "Experience unforgettable trail adventures! With its 150 mm of travel and its agile geometry, the Root Miller 2 offers you everything you need for endless kilometres of fun on the trails. The proven DT Swiss M 1900 Spline aluminium wheelset runs on the legendary Maxxis Minion DHR II and the Maxxis Dissector, which was developed together with racing cyclist Troy Brosnan. This combination perfectly rounds off the potent trail bike and ensures the perfect mix of grip and acceleration. The stroke of the E13 Vario Infinite seat post can be shortened by a total of 30 mm in just a few steps and thus perfectly adapts to your individual needs. * approx. 14.2 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for matt aurora frame, size M, without pedals",
